🤖 Simple Rule-Based Chatbot (Python)

A beginner-friendly Python chatbot built using if-elif-else statements.
This project helps you understand the foundation of how chatbots work before moving into NLP and AI models.

🎯 Objective

Create a simple chatbot that responds based on predefined rules.
It should read user input, match patterns, and return appropriate responses.

🛠 Tools Used

Python

📘 What You Will Learn

Using input() for user interaction

Using loops to keep the chatbot running

Using if-elif-else to create rule-based responses

Basic structure behind NLP systems

📂 Project Structure
Chatbot/
│── chatbot.py       # Main chatbot script
└── README.md

▶️ How It Works

The user types a message

The script checks conditions using if-elif-else

Matches simple keywords like “hello”, “bye”, etc.

Returns a relevant response
